---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import site from '../../../site.config.mjs';

const host = new URL(site.siteUrl).host;
const mail = `mailto:${site.contactEmail}`;
---
<Base
  title="Night Porter | Privacy"
  description="How Night Porter collects, uses and protects the personal information you share through this website."
>
  <main class="wrap dpage">
    <h1 class="h1">Privacy</h1>
    <p class="small muted"><em>Last updated: 10/08/2026</em></p>
    <p class="body">This page explains what personal information Night Porter collects through {host}, how we use it, and the choices you have. Data we process for clients under contract is covered by that client's agreement, not this page. See <a href="/data/">How we handle your data</a>.</p>

    <div class="qa one">
      <section>
        <h2 class="h3">What we collect</h2>
        <p class="body"><strong>Information you give us.</strong> When you book a call or email us, we collect what you send: your name, work email, company, team size and anything you write to us.</p>
        <p class="body"><strong>Information collected automatically.</strong> Like most websites, our hosting provider records basic technical data such as IP address, browser type and pages visited. We use this to keep the site running and secure.</p>
        <p class="body"><strong>Cookies.</strong> We use only the cookies needed for the site and the booking form to work. We don't use advertising or cross-site tracking cookies.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="h3">How we use it</h2>
        <ul class="body bul">
          <li>To schedule and hold calls you book</li>
          <li>To reply to your messages and follow up about your inquiry</li>
          <li>To keep the site secure and working</li>
          <li>To meet legal obligations</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="body">We don't sell your personal information, and we don't share it for advertising.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="h3">Who we share it with</h2>
        <p class="body">Only the service providers that run this site and our communications, such as hosting, scheduling and email. They may use your information only to provide their service to us. We may also disclose information if the law requires it.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="h3">How long we keep it</h2>
        <p class="body">We keep inquiry and booking details for up to <span class="n">24</span> months after our last contact, unless you become a client or ask us to delete them sooner.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="h3">International transfers</h2>
        <p class="body">Our team works from the US and Europe, so your information may be accessed outside the country where you live. When it is, we protect it with appropriate safeguards.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="h3">Your rights</h2>
        <p class="body">Depending on where you live, you may have the right to access, correct, delete or get a copy of your personal information, and to object to how we use it. Email <a href={mail}>{site.contactEmail}</a> and we'll respond within <span class="n">30</span> days. We won't treat you differently for using these rights.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="h3">Security</h2>
        <p class="body">We use reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect your information. No system is perfectly secure, so we can't guarantee absolute security.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="h3">Children</h2>
        <p class="body">This site is for businesses. We don't knowingly collect information from anyone under <span class="n">16</span>.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="h3">Changes to this page</h2>
        <p class="body">If we update this page, we'll change the date at the top.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="h3">Contact</h2>
        <p class="body">Night Porter<br /><a href={mail}>{site.contactEmail}</a></p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
